  "nl_text": "The schemabench_0130 database is designed to store data related to online posts and user interactions. The database consists of eight tables: badges, comments, postHistory, postLinks, posts, tags, users, and votes. The badges table stores information about the badges earned by users, with each badge having a unique ID, a user ID referencing the user who earned it, a name, and a date. The comments table stores comments made on posts, with each comment having a unique ID, a post ID referencing the post it was made on, a score, text, creation date, user ID, and user display name. The postHistory table stores a history of changes made to posts, with each entry having a unique ID, a post ID referencing the post it was made on, a revision GUID, creation date, user ID, text, comment, and user display name. The postLinks table stores links between posts, with each link having a unique ID, creation date, post ID, related post ID, and link type ID. The posts table stores information about individual posts, with each post having a unique ID, post type ID, accepted answer ID, creation date, score, view count, body, owner user ID, last activity date, title, tags, answer count, comment count, favorite count, last editor user ID, last edit date, community owned date, parent post ID, closed date, owner display name, and last editor display name. The tags table stores information about tags used in posts, with each tag having a unique ID, tag name, count, excerpt post ID, and wiki post ID. The users table stores information about users, with each user having a unique ID, reputation, creation date, display name, last access date, website URL, location, about me, views, up votes, down votes, account ID, age, and profile image URL. The votes table stores votes cast on posts, with each vote having a unique ID, post ID, vote type ID, creation date, user ID, and bounty amount.",
  "gold_question": "Background / Context\n\nThe project involves developing a data management system for the Stats Stack Exchange network. The system captures and stores anonymized user-contributed content, facilitating the analysis and tracking of user interactions and contributions within the network.\n\nObjectives\n\nThe primary objective is to create a robust database that organizes and maintains structured data on user activities, posts, comments, and interactions. This supports data analysis and insights generation for community management and improvement.\n\nStakeholders & Users\n\n- Site Administrators: Manage the database and ensure data integrity.\n- Data Analysts: Use the data for insights and reporting.\n- Community Managers: Monitor user interactions and engagement.\n\nFunctional Descriptions\n\n1. User Management: Maintain user profiles, including reputation, display name, and activity metrics.\n2. Post Management: Track posts, including creation dates, scores, view counts, and relationships with other posts.\n3. Comment Management: Record comments with associated metadata like scores, creation dates, and user information.\n4. Badge Management: Log badge awards to users, documenting achievement types and award dates.\n5. Vote Management: Capture votes on posts, detailing the type of vote and any associated bounty amounts.\n6. Tagging System: Organize content using tags; maintain information about tags and their associated posts.\n\nNon-Functional Descriptions\n\n- Scalability: Support a large volume of data with efficient query performance.\n- Data Integrity: Ensure consistency and accuracy of data, with cascade update and delete operations across related tables.\n- Anonymity: Maintain user anonymity while preserving engagement metrics.\n- Security: Protect sensitive data and limit access to authorized personnel only.",
  "input_json": "/data/SchemaBench/Experiment/schema2text_llama31/0130.json",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: schemabench_0130\nCREATE TABLE `badges` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `badges_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `comments` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `post_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `score` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `text` text NOT NULL,\n  `creation_date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `user_display_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `comments_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`post_id`) REFERENCES `posts` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `comments_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `postHistory` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `post_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `revision_guid` char(36) NOT NULL,\n  `creation_date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `text` text NOT NULL,\n  `comment` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `user_display_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `postHistory_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`post_id`) REFERENCES `posts` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `postHistory_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `postLinks` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `creation_date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `post_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `related_post_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `link_type_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `postLinks_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`post_id`) REFERENCES `posts` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `postLinks_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`related_post_id`) REFERENCES `posts` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `posts` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `post_type_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `accepted_answer_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `creation_date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `score` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `view_count` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `body` text NOT NULL,\n  `owner_user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `last_activity_date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `title` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `tags` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `answer_count` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `comment_count` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `favorite_count` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `last_editor_user_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `last_edit_date` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `community_owned_date` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `parent_post_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `closed_date` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `owner_display_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `last_editor_display_name` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `posts_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`accepted_answer_id`) REFERENCES `posts` (`id`) ON DELETE SET NULL ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `posts_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`owner_user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `posts_ibfk_3` FOREIGN KEY (`last_editor_user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE SET NULL ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `posts_ibfk_4` FOREIGN KEY (`parent_post_id`) REFERENCES `posts` (`id`) ON DELETE SET NULL ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `tags` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `tag_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `count` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `excerpt_post_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `wiki_post_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `tags_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`excerpt_post_id`) REFERENCES `posts` (`id`) ON DELETE SET NULL ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `tags_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`wiki_post_id`) REFERENCES `posts` (`id`) ON DELETE SET NULL ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `users` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `reputation` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `creation_date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `display_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `last_access_date` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `website_url` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `location` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `about_me` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `views` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `up_votes` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `down_votes` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `account_id` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `age` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `profile_image_url` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `votes` (\n  `id` int(11) NOT NULL AUTO_INCREMENT,\n  `post_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `vote_type_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `creation_date` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `bounty_amount` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `votes_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`post_id`) REFERENCES `posts` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `votes_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`user_id`) REFERENCES `users` (`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
